  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into wedges.\n• Place wedges on a lined oven tray. Season with salt, drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over sesame seeds and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the wedges between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475b167d7b6ef458c0278a2/step-12f227f2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain and rinse red kidney beans.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Thinly slice pear, then transfer to a medium bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475b167d7b6ef458c0278a2/step-7420ad1b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a second medium bowl, add red kidney beans, onion chutney and the egg. Mash with a potato masher until the red kidney beans are broken up.\n• Add grated carrot, the plain flour, fine breadcrumbs, shredded Cheddar cheese, garlic & herb seasoning and a pinch of salt and pepper. Combine until the mixture is sticking together.\n• Using damp hands, form heaped spoonfuls of the mixture into balls, flattening each ball into a 1cm-thick patty. You should get 4-5 patties per person. TIP: Add a little more flour if the mixture is too wet.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475b167d7b6ef458c0278a2/step-0412c003.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat enough olive oil to coat the base of a large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• When the oil is hot, cook patties until golden, 3-4 minutes each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: Don’t flip before the time is up to ensure your patties can set. TIP: Add more oil if needed to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475b167d7b6ef458c0278a2/step-2efe8138.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the patties are cooking, to the bowl with the pear, add shredded cabbage mix, Japanese style dressing and a drizzle of olive oil. Toss to coat and season to taste.\n• In a small bowl, combine mayonnaise with a drizzle of the soy sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475b167d7b6ef458c0278a2/step-89b3e4da.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide kidney bean patties, sesame wedges and Japanese slaw between plates.\n• Serve with soy mayo. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6475b167d7b6ef458c0278a2/step-0e9c51ee.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
